  "question": {
    "text": "A uniform solid cylindrical roller of mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;is being pulled on horizontal surface with force <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math>&nbsp;parallel to the surface applied at its centre. If the acceleration of the cylinder is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> and it is rolling without slipping, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math> is",
